* "teidän ohjeisiitteja" is the genitive form of "your guidelines" in Finnish. The genitive case is used to indicate possession or origin.
* "eikä henkilöstöesitystäsi" is the negative form of "to staffing proposal" in Finnish. It means "will not support your staffing proposal".

