# Check logs
# No logs are generated for this simple example

# Run tests
# No tests are provided for this simple example

# Investigate the issue
# The issue is caused by trying to add an integer and a string

# Revert to old code
# No old code is provided for this simple example

# Fix the issue
# The issue can be fixed by ensuring that both operands are of the same type

# Test the fix
